The website has opened on my phone.
Steam is rising from my tea on the table.
I look at the screen carefully.
I log into my account.
Then, I go to the profile section.
A new page opens here.
I read the instructions given on the page.
The language of the portal is very formal.
Often difficult words are used on such websites.
I carefully read this official language.
The first instruction is, "The user's information is updated here."
The second instruction is, "All new forms are submitted online."
In another place it is written, "The documents are verified."
Usually such language is not spoken in everyday conversation.
We just say that we are changing the information.
But here every task is done according to the rules.
I find this official way a little strange.
Anyway, I understand all the instructions.
Now I am ready to fill out the new form.
